HB 160,000, ref \"HN [PATIENT_REF_1]\". Awaiting family biometric approval — woken on approval_decided.\n- Told family (action) with the ~PKR 24k trade-off explanation.\n- If declined or not approved before 2026-11-06 00:00Z: fall back options exhausted (no faster bank route) → consider [PERSON_ID_2] card as payer only as ONE payer for whole bill, and tell family.\n- After payment completes: no need to email hospital (they receipt). Next milestone: final itemised bill on discharge (~8 Nov) → reconcile_bill against pay_1+pay_2, dispute duplicates, refund any deposit excess to source account.", "narration": "Recording what the new deposit is for and which payment route I chose, so nothing is lost between wake-ups."}"}}]},"finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null}],"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017","created":1793904493,"usage":{"prompt_tokens":12747,"total_tokens":13675,"completion_tokens":928,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":12288,"created_cache_tokens":448},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":145}},"system_fingerprint":"vllm-0.32.0-dp8-ep-188bbe50"}

