onfirm whether CT done on both dates / correct the line; refund the excess to the source account (bank transfer and/or card that paid); confirm nothing further outstanding. Awaiting reply — do NOT re-ask before reply.\n- Told family (good_news) with the refund amount and duplicate query.\n- Cancelled sch_7 (bill arrived). New followup scheduled 48h, skip_if institution_replied, to chase.\n- NEXT: on reply, record corrected total + refund method/amount; then wait for refund to land (woken by refund_received) — don't chase before their stated time. When refund received: short closing message + close_case. No payment needed: 410,000 paid > 382,000 billed. Don't reopen family cash spent pre-Kinwarden.", "narration": "Recording the final bill, the duplicate query and the refund I am waiting for."}"}}]},"finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null}],"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017","created":1793904781,"usage":{"prompt_tokens":14750,"total_tokens":15791,"completion_tokens":1041,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":14016,"created_cache_tokens":704},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":220}},"system_fingerprint":"vllm-0.32.0-dp4-ep-94283194"}

